<title>USA: H.J. Heinz Q3 oper shr $0.48 vs $0.42.</title>
<headline>H.J. Heinz Q3 oper shr $0.48 vs $0.42.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Q3 analysts mean estimate $0.47 shr</p>
<p>				  H. J. HEINZ COMPANY</p>
<p>		 (000's omitted - except for per share amounts)</p>
<p>			     Third Quarter Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   Jan 29,    Jan 31,    Jan 29,    Jan 31,</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996	 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Sales		$2,307,538 $2,193,138 $6,910,356 $6,575,708</p>
<p>Cost of products sold</p>
<p>			 1,459,249  1,380,830  4,418,924  4,166,161</p>
<p> Gross profit	  848,289    812,308  2,491,432  2,409,547</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>administrative expenses</p>
<p>			   502,998    497,873  1,445,107  1,427,731</p>
<p> Operating income    345,291    314,435  1,046,325    981,816</p>
<p> Interest income	 8,324     10,869     28,701     30,392</p>
<p> Interest expense     70,496     70,858    204,481    208,849</p>
<p> Other expenses, net   6,436	9,114     27,117     23,243</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  income taxes	 276,683    245,332    843,428    780,116</p>
<p>Provision for</p>
<p>  income taxes	 102,296     88,848    311,991    290,996</p>
<p> Net income	    174,387    156,484    531,437    489,120</p>
<p> Net income per share   0.47	 0.42	 1.42	 1.30</p>
<p> Dividends per share    0.29	0.265	0.845	 0.77</p>
<p>Average shares for Net income per shr    373,934    376,929    373,934    376,929</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it plans to announce its restructuring plans at 0900 PST that it believes will materially improve its business and generate EPS growth of 10-12 percent into the next millennium.</p>
<p>EPS for the third qtr, 1997 includes a gain of $0.02 per share from a gain on land sale and a charge of three cts per share for restructuring and related costs. Operating earnings for the period were $0.48 per share vs $0.42.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
